            "value": "水平标尺"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "颜色与所选取的颜色相差多远仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far apart the screen's lines are": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "网屏中线条之间的间距"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个颜色通道 (0–255) 与所点击的颜色相差多少仍会被选中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锐化从每个边缘向外延伸的距离，以像素为单位。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in brightness the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在亮度上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in hue the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在色相上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far in saturation the adjustment reaches.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "调整在饱和度上的影响范围。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How far the blur softens, in pixels": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "模糊柔化的距离，以像素为单位"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个像素的误差向相邻像素扩散的程度。数值越小，区域越平坦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile distortion correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件扭曲度校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "应用配置文件晕影校正的程度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "曲线同时改变颜色强度的程度。0 与 Photoshop 一致；较低时仅影响亮度，较高时增加更多颜色。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hue": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
